WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.603 --> 00:00:05.944
- [Ila] The film business
loves to put people in boxes.

00:00:05.944 --> 00:00:08.376
You gotta play someone
who just had a car crash,

00:00:08.376 --> 00:00:10.323
because you're in a wheelchair.

00:00:10.323 --> 00:00:13.323
Here it's like, you don't have that.

00:00:17.789 --> 00:00:19.154
- [Peter] The dream is to change the way

00:00:19.154 --> 00:00:21.654
disability is seen in America.

00:00:22.793 --> 00:00:25.320
There's so much talent and
you see it here with this crew.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.958
- I'm Ila Halby, and I'm one of the

00:00:26.958 --> 00:00:28.412
directors at Zeno Mountain Farm.

00:00:28.412 --> 00:00:31.268
- Hi, I'm Peter Halby,
another director at Zeno.

00:00:31.268 --> 00:00:34.249
Our mission is to support
lifelong friendship

00:00:34.249 --> 00:00:37.967
and opportunity for people
with or without disabilities.

00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:40.205
It's important for us
to have the integration.

00:00:40.205 --> 00:00:42.499
- [Ila] We've run camps all year long.

00:00:42.499 --> 00:00:45.832
- And right now, we're at our film camp.

00:00:47.307 --> 00:00:49.482
We've been making movies for about 12 years now,

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.229
we've done all different types of genres

00:00:51.229 --> 00:00:55.629
from a sports drama movie,
we did a time travel movie,

00:00:55.629 --> 00:00:59.267
we did a superheroes movie, a western

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:01.405
and this year, we're doing
a high school musical.

00:01:01.405 --> 00:01:04.220
- Alright, let's roll camera.

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:06.189
- The last film we did,
we went to film festivals

00:01:06.189 --> 00:01:10.387
all over and the hope is that
we get to do that with this.

00:01:10.387 --> 00:01:12.921
Every aspect of this film,
we have disabled talent

00:01:12.921 --> 00:01:17.414
from the casting to the
lighting, to the script-writing.

00:01:17.414 --> 00:01:19.115
- Hi, I'm Alec Bandler.

00:01:19.115 --> 00:01:19.948
- Bill James.

00:01:19.948 --> 00:01:21.775
- Andrew Pilkington.

00:01:21.775 --> 00:01:23.201
- Debbie Beidl.

00:01:23.201 --> 00:01:24.534
- Noah Lelchook.

00:01:34.464 --> 00:01:36.364
- I'm an actor.

00:01:36.364 --> 00:01:38.281
I love being in movies.

00:01:40.327 --> 00:01:42.588
- [Ila] We have two really
exciting leads for this movie.

00:01:42.588 --> 00:01:43.970
Ricky and Roxy.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.150
- Go for Roxy.

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.630
- Hi, my name is Ricky Wilson Jr

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:48.507
and I'm playing Tony Michaels.

00:01:48.507 --> 00:01:51.147
- Hi, my name is Roxanne
Schiebergen and I'm playing Sage.

00:01:51.147 --> 00:01:52.325
- You guys ready?

00:01:52.325 --> 00:01:53.760
Let's roll the music.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:58.022
- The film is basically
about two teenagers

00:01:58.022 --> 00:02:01.689
who go to summer camp
and they fall in love.

00:02:03.315 --> 00:02:06.926
- It's sort of an homage
to a lot of the classics

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:09.835
such as, Grease, Footloose.

00:02:09.835 --> 00:02:12.315
- All the disability just fades away here

00:02:12.315 --> 00:02:15.150
and everyone's just a person.

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:18.596
In the outside film world, disability

00:02:18.596 --> 00:02:20.238
has to be written in the story.

00:02:20.238 --> 00:02:21.538
People have to know why.

00:02:21.538 --> 00:02:24.238
My character, Sage,
it's never discussed why

00:02:24.238 --> 00:02:27.598
she's in a wheelchair and
I think that's so awesome.

00:02:27.598 --> 00:02:29.598
- Yeah, it's incredible.

00:02:32.664 --> 00:02:35.443
- Everyone's just beaming, constantly.

00:02:35.443 --> 00:02:37.741
This is their lives, they live for Zeno

00:02:37.741 --> 00:02:40.824
and you can feel it when you're here.

00:02:41.683 --> 00:02:43.363
- In the disability world, there’s, there’s this

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:47.096
isolation, there's this lack
of opportunity that exists.

00:02:47.096 --> 00:02:49.965
At Zeno, everyone understands each other,

00:02:49.965 --> 00:02:54.132
wants to connect and to
find the talent in everyone.

